"║┌Highlights──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐║"
"║│  [Fixed] **PRD `[R]` reset** now requires a second `R` to confirm before deleting the local PRD file; the footer shows a confirm warning while armed and any other key cancels.│║"
"║│  [Fixed] **Kill-session confirm** no longer treats `Enter` as "kill" — only `y` confirms, matching the overlay's `[y]`/`[n]` hint. A reflexive `Enter` (the confirm/default key│║"
"║│  [Fixed] **Adapt follow-up** number keys `1-9` now only move the selection; `Enter` is the sole launch key. Previously a stray digit immediately spawned a billable session.   │║"
"║│  [Fixed] **Adapt wizard cache-clear** (`x`/`Del`) now requires a second press to confirm before wiping the resumable cache; the keybind hint reflects the armed state.         │║"
"║│                                                                                                                                                                                │║"
